WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:03.435
Logs lists every call your agents handled

00:00:03.435 --> 00:00:06.453
Expand a retried call to see each attempt

00:00:06.453 --> 00:00:08.642
Click Filters

00:00:08.642 --> 00:00:10.764
Pick a date range

00:00:10.764 --> 00:00:14.348
Choose an assistant

00:00:14.348 --> 00:00:18.727
Narrow by call status

00:00:18.727 --> 00:00:20.129
Applied filters show as chips

00:00:20.129 --> 00:00:23.301
Click a call to open it

00:00:23.301 --> 00:00:25.428
Recording, latency, variables and analysis

00:00:25.428 --> 00:00:28.150
Open Advanced analysis

00:00:28.150 --> 00:00:31.182
Read the transcript

00:00:31.182 --> 00:00:36.665
Click a tool call to see its request and response

00:00:36.665 --> 00:00:39.268
Tools run before, during and after the call

00:00:39.268 --> 00:00:43.279
Evals score the call, metric by metric

00:00:43.279 --> 00:00:48.129
Export the list by email

00:00:48.129 --> 00:00:55.738
WhatsApp: the same view for chats

00:00:55.738 --> 00:00:59.647
Workflows: one row per workflow run
